    "detailed_description": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1487160/extras/e221cd1de0bc52bbb5b25fd05ceca886.avif?t=1736599489\" /></div><br><br>A game full of action and lots, lots of fun.<br>Play numerous maps together with your friends or alone against bots. Test yourself on numerous maps and win, becoming the best ever.<br><br>Choose the character, the map and get into action, dominate the ranking and beat everyone.<br><br><strong>The main mode is all against all up to 6 real players and up to 8 against bots.</strong> You will be able to overtake the others?<br>Within the game you survive, collecting weapons, medikit, ammunition and much more.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">New Maps, Characters and Weapons, Soon to Arrive.</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Stay Tuned</h2>",
